      "id": "S1-unit-scope",
      "kind": "SenML Pack illustration",
      "raw_json": "[{\"bn\":\"https://example.org/sensors/\",\"bu\":\"Cel\",\"n\":\"a\",\"v\":20},{\"n\":\"b\",\"u\":\"K\",\"v\":20},{\"n\":\"c\",\"v\":20}]",
      "raw_sha256": "c958301c89f5fa6319a88e077581e1aa53e5e1e274f0bacee8d607ef01c14e4b",
      "raw_bytes": 107,
      "execution_status": "UNEXECUTED",
      "actual_result": null,
      "source_ids": [
        "SM1"
      ],
      "source_locations": "4:328-345; 4.1:354-357; 4.5.2:521-526; 12.1:1695,1713",
      "source_derived_interpretation_zh": "按记录顺序为 20 Cel、20 K、20 Cel。u:K 只覆盖第二条，不把 bu 改成 K；相同 JSON 数字不证明同一测量量值。",
      "limits_zh": "不能把第二条称为第一条的温标换算；示例名称是合成占位标识，实际使用须保证资源全局唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S2-value-base-reset",
      "kind": "SenML Pack illustration",
      "raw_json": "[{\"bn\":\"https://example.org/sensors/\",\"bu\":\"Cel\",\"bv\":20,\"n\":\"a\",\"v\":1},{\"n\":\"b\",\"v\":2},{\"bv\":0,\"n\":\"c\",\"v\":2},{\"n\":\"d\",\"v\":3}]",
      "raw_sha256": "fdc0e692ef821ae7526c38513afe5073a4ec0ab3aa6d4be58ab7d3786f577a29",
      "raw_bytes": 127,
      "execution_status": "UNEXECUTED",
      "actual_result": null,
      "source_ids": [
        "SM1"
      ],
      "source_locations": "4:328-345; 4.1:359-360; 4.5.4:594-596; senml.go:99-109",
      "source_derived_interpretation_zh": "源条文推导的数值/单位依次是 21 Cel、22 Cel、2 Cel、3 Cel；bv:0 从第三条开始替换 20，省略 bv 不是重置。",
      "limits_zh": "每条明确给出 v，避免把缺字段补零规则误当作任意无值记录均合法。bv 是数值加法，不是单位转换、校准或误差修正声明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S3-missing-unit-vs-ratio",
      "kind": "SenML Pack illustration",
      "raw_json": "[{\"bn\":\"https://example.org/sensors/\",\"n\":\"unknown\",\"v\":0.5},{\"n\":\"ratio\",\"u\":\"/\",\"v\":0.5}]",
      "raw_sha256": "337e8510fd0027c10db9cb3f735ab60a34da5dfd0ca98d5925377238cb75848e",
      "raw_bytes": 91,
      "execution_status": "UNEXECUTED",
      "actual_result": null,
      "source_ids": [
        "SM1"
      ],
      "source_locations": "4.5.2:523-526; 12.1:1750-1754,1774-1779",
      "source_derived_interpretation_zh": "第一条单位未由此 Pack 声明，需应用上下文；第二条显式声明 / 比率单位。不能因为两条数字相同就把第一条当无量纲或比率。",
      "limits_zh": "这是完整独立 Pack，没有先前 bu；如果将第一条截取自其他 Pack，必须先确认继承状态。不得用空字符串 u 代替这个缺失示例。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S4-significant-digits",
      "kind": "SenML Pack illustration",
      "raw_json": "[{\"bn\":\"https://example.org/sensors/\",\"bu\":\"Cel\",\"n\":\"a\",\"v\":1.1},{\"n\":\"b\",\"v\":1.10}]",
      "raw_sha256": "2ea481d42921e5186da16b90b8e441fd4fe60f3f18720c2c89c05c9c55109b42",
