      ],
      "source_locations": "5:745-754; 4.5.4:598-601; 4.7:652-655",
      "source_derived_interpretation_zh": "在固定 SenML 数值语义中 1.1 与 1.10 无差别；尾零不编码测量准确度或有效数字承诺。这不是两个传感器测量质量相同的证明。",
      "limits_zh": "必须保留 raw_json 字符串的原始词法用于展示；解析并重序列化可抹掉 1.10 的尾零。不能据此承诺十进制精确往返。"
    },
    {
      "id": "S5-valid-json-wrong-value-type",
      "kind": "SenML Pack illustration",
      "raw_json": "[{\"n\":\"https://example.org/sensors/a\",\"u\":\"Cel\",\"v\":\"20\"}]",
      "raw_sha256": "15716e77a59e0e39b7b4eee181cd1b940edb33c440dcef94e1a572e44b43e95c",
      "raw_bytes": 58,
      "execution_status": "UNEXECUTED",
      "actual_result": null,
      "source_ids": [
        "SM1"
      ],
